# CircleLink — Phase PR Workflow (paused)

**Paused** while architecture phases 1–33 run under
`.cursor/rules/architecture-refactor-branching.mdc`.

Do not use this rule until that refactor is finished and the architecture rule is retired.

## Legacy (for reference)

After an MVP phase was done:

1. Branch `phase-<N>-<short-name>` from `main`
2. Commit `Phase N: <short description>`
3. Push + `gh pr create` → `main`

One phase = one PR. Never push phase work straight to `main`.
